@startuml bitmanipulation_dynamic

' A user sets and checks a flag in a scoped-enum bitmask and a bit in an integer.
actor User
participant bit_manipulation <<unit>>
participant bitmask_operators <<unit>>

User -> bitmask_operators : operator|
User -> bitmask_operators : operator&
User -> bit_manipulation : SetBit
User -> bit_manipulation : CheckBit

@enduml
